# reCAPTCHA v3. Public by design — it identifies the site to Google and is
# visible in the page source. The matching secret belongs in api/.env as
# RECAPTCHA_SECRET, and that one is not public.
#
# Left empty, the browser asks for no token and the API accepts posts without
# one. Production refuses to start without the secret, so the two cannot drift
# apart unnoticed.
# Where staff and teachers sign in. Shown to an account that holds one of
# those roles, which is the only way in from the public site.
VITE_ADMIN_URL=http://localhost:5173

VITE_RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=
